        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "It's me. The spokesman incident is over\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "......Platinum.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who are you? I'm looking for the director...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't matter. You should have received the authorization code for this terminal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since you know about this channel, you aren't one of the two Lazurites. So...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just keep your suspicions to yourself and refrain from looking too hard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "What I am saying next will be between the 'Armorless Union', and nothing to do with the 'directors'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "......Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "A squad of campaign knights crossed into the Twilight Wood in secret. This went unnoticed by the General Chamber of Commerce, so it likely has something to do with the Radiant Knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Silverlance...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Lazurite will take full responsibility for this matter, don't trouble yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haah? Since when are they so responsible?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your mission is to monitor the Radiant Knight in their stead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Radiant Knight... that's a pain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014So they've got an even bigger pain over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still unclear. The ripples from a single stone spread far. The return of the Radiant Knight has brought us a lot of trouble... In fact, we're devoting too much of our attention on her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "text": "...One more thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what, do not take action against the Sarkaz with the Radiant Knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "text": "Those two Sarkaz... You seem to know a lot about them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Confessarius and the Radiant Knight also belong to another 'company.' Will this matter be so simple...? I'm not sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
