    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Those stupid competition knights are just a bunch of trash willing to be manipulated for the sake of money.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the young mistress of the Nearl family were to have an accident as well, don't even bother calling this campaign knight a knight anymore! I'll go flip the National Council's goddamned table myself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014That's what the old man said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Senomy, there's no need to mimic him so convincingly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_237_gravel"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ehh, but he specifically instructed me to convey the exact message.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't need to listen to everything he says.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_237_gravel"
    },
    {
        "text": "He even said that if the Grand Knight didn't agree, he'd go greet the Radiant Knight himself, even if he had to hobble all the way there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_237_gravel"
    },
    {
        "text": "He also said that if you sighed and cupped your forehead, reluctant to answer, he would\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright... I know how unhappy he is. He hasn't changed at all, still causing a ruckus in the Court Sprawiedliwi Kazimierz every day over what few accomplishments he has...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget he is still an offender.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_237_gravel"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the National Council, totally corrupted by the General Chamber of Commerce, has no right to convict my old man. They don't representing the citizens or the law at all. They're just representing themselves and the merchants behind them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...He taught you that as well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_237_gravel"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I figured that one out myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_237_gravel"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, there's one more thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "??? "
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_237_gravel"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people from Rhodes Island seem to have arrived.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senomy"
    },
